title: Chapter1_1
position: -380,338
---
Sir Oreon: Hmmph! You have guts, kids.
Sir Oreon: You know what? I shall give you a chance!
<<PlayTimeline "enemyStorySprite_Jump_Anim">>
<<StorySpriteSwap_HAPPY>>
Sir Oreon: If you can defeat me, I shall let you pass!
Adventurer: So do we just... beat each other up?
Sir Oreon: Oh god no!
<<StorySpriteSwap_MAD>>
<<PlayTimeline "enemyStorySprite_Jump_Anim">>
Sir Oreon: We shall duel like gentlemen!
<<StorySpriteSwap_IDLE>>
Sir Oreon: Do you need me to explain to you how it works?
-> Yes please!
    Sir Oreon: Sure! It is very simple.
    <<PlayTimeline TutorialDisplay_IMG>>
    Sir Oreon: You can see there are two wheels above our head. It will decided on our action.
    Sir Oreon: At the start of your turn, the wheel will randomly select for you.
    Sir Oreon: Then your goal is to stop MY wheel on the tile that is advantage for you!
    Sir Oreon: You can use the button or click E to stop. The color corresponding to rock, paper or scissor. There is an image near the button.
    Sir Oreon: If you stop my wheel on the item weaker than you, you hit me for 1 HP.
    Sir Oreon: If you stop my wheel on the same item as your, we both do not do any damage.
    Sir Oreon: If you stop my wheel on the item stronger than you, I counterattack and hit you for 1 HP.
    Adventurer: I see. What about your turn?
    Sir Oreon: Good question! Similarly, when it is my turn, the wheel will automatically stop for me.
    <<PlayTimelineReverse TutorialDisplay_IMG>>
    Sir Oreon: This time you have to click stop for your wheel!
-> No, thank you.
    <<SetSlowDownSpeed 0.1>>
    Sir Oreon: Alright then!
<<jump Chapter1_2>>
===

